# 📘 TOEFL Academic Vocabulary - Day27

| Word | Meaning | Example |
|---|---|---|
| facilitate | 촉진하다, 용이하게 하다 | Technology can facilitate communication. |
| retain | 유지하다, 보유하다 | The soil can retain water. |
| adapt | 적응하다 | Animals must adapt to environmental changes. |

---

## Synonyms

### facilitate
→ enable / make easier

### retain
→ keep / preserve

### adapt
→ adjust

---

## Useful Collocations

facilitate communication
→ 의사소통을 촉진하다

retain information
→ 정보를 기억하다 / 유지하다

adapt to changes
→ 변화에 적응하다

